{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0514_1000_p", "source_sha256": "18acc13563d0a7bc974813592b34748bcc4a683933bd4b701a9788bec5b5f880", "ja": "（人魚姫をテーマにした映画へ出演したロコ。\n撮影は順調に進み、無事クランクアップした……）", "zh": "（出演了以人鱼公主为主题的电影的ROCO。拍摄进展顺利，也平安杀青了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0514_1001_p", "source_sha256": "fa4828b4744e289aacd57b11ed9496234bf7e1499a2d2e80b073e3d888a69de8", "ja": "お疲れ様、ロコ。\n良い映画になりそうだって、監督も喜んでたよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，ROCO。\n导演也很高兴，说这部电影看起来会拍得很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0514_1002_025roc", "source_sha256": "d05d69104c2e7c890d341fff6377a3877b066a26bf68f439d4ebf87a3fd41342", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。よかったです、\nそう言ってもらえてホッとしました……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。太好了，您能这么说，我就放心了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0514_1003_p", "source_sha256": "9363f1d61d99e1f954a179e9c6410149facec8f8508264297d1fa2fdc3dab6d8", "ja": "ん？　そういう割には元気がないな。\n撮影で何かあったのか？", "zh": "嗯？话是这么说，你看起来却没什么精神呢。\n拍摄时出什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0514_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "c4bc8d49bf6e09b9d05ff4ea612cead3a6f8c1c4453afecba17949321e9e945d", "ja": "はっ、い、いえ！　ロコもアクトには、\nサティスファクションしてますよ！　……ただ。", "zh": "啊，不，不是！我对ROCO的表演也很满意！……只是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0514_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "a704f879750ebaca7aaf80dd3e792af13f6b85a00428c96b7615b54bf7e8e3e9", "ja": "ラストシーンが、どうしても気になってしまって……。", "zh": "我还是忍不住在意最后一幕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0514_1006_p", "source_sha256": "85a106978f4b1e754b26570399123a0ed222572912417d48fcc0d1fa08267621", "ja": "ラスト……人魚姫が泡になって、\n海へ消えてしまうシーンのことだな。", "zh": "结尾……就是那一幕吧，美人鱼化作泡沫，消失在大海中的场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0514_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "20064153b8966918a1e2bca4606499237f2996472123a69e0b71e98dfc382274", "ja": "はい……ハートがとても……。シナリオを\n読んだ時は、そんな風に思わなかったんですけど……。", "zh": "是的……心里特别难受……读剧本的时候，倒没觉得会这样……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0514_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "9098244f6f533f7340c8cf312972ce1260841a3692593558ac3d50e1b31d8cdc", "ja": "ずっとマーメイドプリンセスをアクトしていたせいか、\nエンパシーしちゃったみたいです。", "zh": "可能是因为一直在饰演人鱼公主，不知不觉产生共鸣了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0514_1009_p", "source_sha256": "21d546cbec4e5de7570dbd73f2f02e455b875b4dcff621556f17cede7559198f", "ja": "エンパシー……感情移入したってこと、かな？\nいい演技だったからな。なるほど……。", "zh": "共情……也就是说，投入感情了吧？\n毕竟演得很好嘛。原来如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0514_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "e84b56a87176e9fa0ca78c035687f9a451f3f8af2ca69a5e392e5c7ca98f350a", "ja": "もちろん、これがトゥルーエンドだということは\n理解してるの。でも、ロコは……ロコは！", "zh": "当然，我也理解\n这是True End。可是，ROCO她……ROCO她！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0514_1011_p", "source_sha256": "75cc6de8004da0537a43d0e3c6542ac612435b8da13534fdba65d1a15c81260f", "ja": "ま、まあまあ……少し落ち着いて。\nきっと、気持ちが消化しきれないのかもな。", "zh": "好、好了……先冷静一下。\n你可能只是还没完全消化这份心情吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0514_1012_p", "source_sha256": "fc83e75f4a686b870913ac751df86dcf5fda3b5f06e493405065598a4243f4a6", "ja": "そうだ！　それならロコらしい方法で、人魚姫の幸せな\nエンディングを表現してみるのはどうだ？", "zh": "对了！那就用符合ROCO风格的方法，来表现人鱼公主的幸福结局，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0514_1013_025roc", "source_sha256": "233ffa19b8b0f11dd2583f8fa139848f7db64950dcac037ba4f7f6ad0d5d27a9", "ja": "ロコらしい、方法……？", "zh": "符合ROCO风格的方法……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0514_1014_p", "source_sha256": "214294e6594bcecaa51014a81aeb1d65a82e1302df88b0080422499deecbdcf8", "ja": "ああ。多分、ロコと同じように感じてる人が\nたくさんいると思う。だからロコが代弁するんだ。", "zh": "啊。我想，应该有很多人和ROCO有着同样的感受。所以就由ROCO来替他们发声吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0514_1015_p", "source_sha256": "4221250ee172b641341b761dd36ebadec53ca38be1978a4ddccc7e00e8ac4f7f", "ja": "気持ちを形にする方法を、\nロコはもう持っていると思うけど……。", "zh": "我想，ROCO已经拥有将心情化为具体形式的方法了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0514_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "534964d1e85c8d7428de051bc1ff02b6a6321ec8ce18c2451833d38582921103", "ja": "……あっ、ロコアートですね！　それなら\nロコの気持ちも、エクスプレッションできるかも！", "zh": "……啊，ROCO艺术！这样的话，连ROCO的心情也许也能表达出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0514_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "249a795ee5b4c78ea019b480ed750988c4a29794033c38e26b43457fa02cb853", "ja": "撮影でのエクスペリエンスを活かして……\nロコのフィーリングをシェイプして……。", "zh": "活用拍摄时的体验……塑造出ROCO的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0514_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "6c95607187743fd9fda9a0919bca554b7330abcf20a0700f6310b906bbf52555", "ja": "うん！　とってもアメイジングで、みんなが\nハッピーになるような、アートができそうです♪", "zh": "嗯！感觉能创作出非常惊艳、让大家都开心的艺术作品呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0514_1019_p", "source_sha256": "aa3ab524f78f237e8330937cc2614c7f0b6f9b007759d9560b8a7ba35445081d", "ja": "ははっ、そうか！　ロコが、どんなエンディングを\n考えるのか、今から楽しみにしているよ。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊！我很期待ROCO会构思出怎样的结局。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0514_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "2fdbb38df63cd7050ef32edbb2269e68e35ccf12a51e442212c922784da184cb", "ja": "はい！　ロコにしか作れない、\n最高のグッドエンディングにしてみせますよ♪", "zh": "是！我一定会把它做成只有ROCO才能创造出的、最棒的美好结局♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0514_1021_025roc", "source_sha256": "358dae669397b356409360da903c08e6b808ef9c075be0d9157d26da812cfec9", "ja": "ううう～……早速帰って、スケッチしないとっ！\n早く帰りましょう、{$P$}！", "zh": "呜呜呜～……得赶紧回去画草图才行！我们快回去吧，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0514_1022_p", "source_sha256": "98705446dae7cbffd908ac73a130d1c146c1d3ebad0156878dca8b7f577aa7e2", "ja": "（感受性の強いロコだからこそ表現できる、人魚姫の\n新たな世界。どんなアートになるか、楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（正因为是感受力丰富的ROCO，才能表现出人鱼公主崭新的世界。真期待她会创作出怎样的艺术作品！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
